#. Skin Element Text: txt-welcome / Text
msgid ""
"Selamat datang di Menara Siger, menara siger yaitu menara yang menjadi titik "
"0, Menara Siger dibangun dengan memperhatikan ciri khas Komunitas Budaya "
"Lampung Pepadun. Di sekitar tugu dibangun ruang-ruang yang menampilkan "
"budaya Lampung serta sarana-prasarana pariwisata. Sebagai tugu di ujung "
"Pulau Sumatra, Menara Siger dilengkapi dengan tulisan penanda Titik Nol "
"Pulau Sumatra. Menara Siger dengan warna emas itu dilengkapi ruangan tempat "
"wisatawan melihat Pelabuhan Bakauheni serta keindahan panorama laut dan alam "
"sekitarnya."
msgstr ""
"Welcome to the Siger Tower, a landmark that marks Kilometer Zero. The Siger "
"Tower was built with attention to the distinctive characteristics of the "
"Lampung Pepadun cultural community. Around the monument, there are spaces "
"that showcase Lampung culture and tourism facilities. As a monument located "
"at the tip of Sumatra Island, the Siger Tower features an inscription "
"marking the Zero Point of Sumatra Island. The golden-colored Siger Tower is "
"equipped with rooms where visitors can view Bakauheni Port and enjoy the "
"beautiful panorama of the sea and surrounding nature."

